Here's a breakdown of creating your React app with the specified functionality, tailored for VS Code on macOS:

**1. Project Setup (Using Create React App)**

*   **Install Node.js & npm:**  Ensure you have Node.js and npm (package manager included) installed on your macOS system. Download from [https://nodejs.org/](https://nodejs.org/) if needed.
*   **Create React App:**
    ```bash
